{
  "name": "20 · Document Chaser (Kaamchor AI · MAP 2.0 · Ops)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 20 · Doc Chaser\nJo documents client ne abhi tak nahi bheje: din 2, 5 aur 9 pe follow-up (pehle pyaar se, phir firm). 12 din baad bhi nahi → owner ko \"call kar lo\" alert.\n\n**Setup (10 min)**\n1. Google Sheets: **Google Sheets OAuth2** credential, paste your sheet URL in place of YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_URL. Tab **Pending docs**: Client, Phone, Document, Asked on, Reminders, Status (pending/received).\n2. WhatsApp nodes: **WhatsApp Business Cloud API** credential + your **Phone Number ID** (replace YOUR_PHONE_NUMBER_ID).\n3. AI model: **Anthropic** credential (or swap the model node for OpenAI / Gemini).\n4. Replace YOUR_CA_WHATSAPP. Workflow 01 can set Status = received automatically.",
        "height": 540,
        "width": 360,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "ae1d4648-7524-4330-a15b-a66d88109aa1",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -400,
        -360
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "triggerAtHour": 11,
              "triggerAtMinute": 0
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "334cf317-785b-4750-a0e2-3a19c6902f2a",
      "name": "Daily 11 AM",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "url",
          "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_URL"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "Pending docs"
        },
        "options": {},
        "filtersUI": {
          "values": [
            {
              "lookupColumn": "Status",
              "lookupValue": "=pending"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "5bca921c-ca3b-4800-b953-949dc1a6aa74",
      "name": "Pending documents",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ],
      "alwaysOutputData": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Pending docs tab: Client, Phone, Document, Asked on (yyyy-mm-dd), Reminders, Status\n// stage 1 = day 2 (polite), 2 = day 5 (firm), 3 = day 9 (deadline risk), after that → alert the owner instead\nconst STAGES = { 2: 1, 5: 2, 9: 3 };\nconst out = [];\nfor (const { json: r } of $input.all()) {\n  if (!r.Phone || !r['Asked on']) continue;\n  const days = Math.round($now.startOf('day').diff(DateTime.fromISO(r['Asked on']), 'days').days);\n  if (STAGES[days]) out.push({ json: { ...r, days, stage: STAGES[days], escalate: false } });\n  else if (days === 12) out.push({ json: { ...r, days, stage: 4, escalate: true } });\n}\nreturn out;"
      },
      "id": "45ab46ee-5e45-46ee-89cf-95ea7d30c746",
      "name": "Follow-up stage",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
